---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="review" number="03" label="Review" title="Diffs, findings, request changes.">
  <p class="sub">
    Reviews built in. Read the diff and the findings, then request changes.
  </p>
  <figure>
    <img
      class="shot"
      src="/shots/review.jpg"
      alt="The Review view: three runs waiting for review, an empty merge queue"
      width="1680"
      height="960"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <figcaption class="caption">Review. What needs you, what's landing, what landed.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Section>

<style>
  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
